# Build context exclusions for the SomaFractalMemory standalone image.
# Dockerfile is at infra/standalone/Dockerfile.
# Rule 164: a secret is Vault material and must never be baked into an image.
# This file did not exist before -- `.env` and `infra/standalone/.env` were
# both entering the build context.

# --- secret MATERIAL (directories and formats, not name substrings) ---------
# Do NOT use *token* / *password* globs: they match real source
# (test_vault_token_file_only.py, settings model code).
infra/standalone/secrets/
**/vault_root_token
**/vault_unseal_key
**/*_vault_root_token
**/*_vault_unseal_key

# --- env files at every depth ----------------------------------------------
# A bare `.env` matches only the repo root; `infra/standalone/.env` is a real
# file here too.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# --- key and certificate FORMATS -------------------------------------------
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.cer
*.der
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa*
id_ecdsa*
id_ed25519*

# --- VCS --------------------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore

# --- Python -----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
*.egg-info
somafractalmemory.egg-info
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.coverage
htmlcov
.hypothesis
.benchmarks

# --- virtualenvs ------------------------------------------------------------
env
venv
.venv

# --- IDE / OS ---------------------------------------------------------------
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store

# --- type-checker / lint output --------------------------------------------
pyright_errors_*.json
pyrightconfig.json

# --- docs and generated site not needed at runtime --------------------------
docs
site
mkdocs.yml
*.md
!README.md

# --- data and logs ----------------------------------------------------------
data
*.log
tmp
